# `agents.post_feedback`

Post a FeedbackEvent to the studio canvas (rate-limited for agents).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.feedback.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `event_json` | `string` |

## Returns

`PostFeedbackResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.post_feedback --json '{ "event_json": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "01J9Z3KQ8F7X2YB4MC6N0VTRWS"
